{
  "key": 25646,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_LavenderTown_House2_Text_WantMeToRateNicknames",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, hello!\n",
        "I am the official Name Rater!\r",
        "Want me to rate the nicknames of\n",
        "your Pokémon?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_TrainingHouse_Text_WinstonIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "A quiet town needs a lively\n",
        "battle now and then.\r",
        "Want to battle?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_TrainingHouse_Text_After",
      "en_US": [
        "Come back any time you want\n",
        "to battle again!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_TrainingHouse_Text_EdithIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Even Ghost Pokémon can land\n",
        "a hit on my team. Try it!\r",
        "Want to battle?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_PaintWorld_Text_FigureFirst",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …\r",
        "A figure made of paint turns to\n",
        "face you. It raises a brush."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_LavenderTown_House2_Text_Tip",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello, hello!\n",
        "I am the official Name Rater!\r",
        "Before we begin, a little secret.\n",
        "You don’t need me to rename\f",
        "your Pokémon!\r",
        "You may give a Pokémon a new\n",
        "nickname whenever you like.\r",
        "Just open its Summary, and press\n",
        "A on the first page to Rename it.\r",
        "Of course, a Pokémon from another\n",
        "Trainer keeps the name it has.\r",
        "Now then!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_LavenderTown_House2_Text_StillWantRating",
      "en_US": [
        "Want me to rate the nicknames of\n",
        "your Pokémon all the same?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_TrainingHouse_Text_Declined",
      "en_US": "Whenever you’re ready, then."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_PaintWorld_Text_FigureSketch",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …\r",
        "The figure’s colors swirl.\n",
        "It’s waiting for you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_PaintWorld_Text_FigureMega",
      "en_US": [
        "… … …\r",
        "The figure is holding a stone that\n",
        "shines in every color."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_PaintWorld_Text_Dissolve",
      "en_US": [
        "The figure runs like wet paint…\n",
        "The world around it does too."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_LavenderTown_House2_Text_CritiqueWhichMonsNickname",
      "en_US": [
        "Which Pokémon’s nickname should\n",
        "I critique?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_LavenderTown_House2_Text_ISeeComeVisitAgain",
      "en_US": [
        "I see.\n",
        "Do come visit again."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_LavenderTown_House2_Text_GiveItANicerName",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, is it?\n",
        "That is a decent nickname!\r",
        "But, would you like me to give it\n",
        "a nicer name?\r",
        "How about it?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_LavenderTown_House2_Text_ThatIsMerelyAnEgg",
      "en_US": [
        "Now, now.\n",
        "That is merely an Egg!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_LavenderTown_House2_Text_TrulyImpeccableName",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, is it?\n",
        "That is a truly impeccable name!\r",
        "Take good care of {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_LavenderTown_House2_Text_WhatShallNewNicknameBe",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, good. Then, what shall the new\n",
        "nickname be?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_LavenderTown_House2_Text_FromNowOnShallBeKnownAsSameName",
      "en_US": [
        "Done! From now on, this Pokémon\n",
        "shall be known as {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "It looks no different from before,\n",
        "and yet, this is vastly superior!\r",
        "How fortunate for you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_LavenderTown_House2_Text_FromNowOnShallBeKnownAsName",
      "en_US": [
        "Done! From now on, this Pokémon\n",
        "shall be known as {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "It is a better name than before!\n",
        "How fortunate for you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0480_T05R0401_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
        "(Canvas DS: this part of the game\n",
        "isn’t ported yet.)"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
